<title>SOUTH KOREA: Korea Zinc 1996 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Korea Zinc 1996 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	  (In billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			   475  vs	  700</p>
<p>    Net Profit			 8.16  vs	12.04</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	     10.59  vs	14.90</p>
<p>    Turnover			 528.47  vs     344.95</p>
<p>    Extraordinary	   loss   1.64  vs gain  0.02</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won) 6.0  vs	 10.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Korea Zinc Co Ltd said its net profit fell because it made a large investment in a zinc refinery in Australia. The weakening won also pressured the company's net profit.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
